00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.480
They can focus on building
great voice experiences

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.470
for your customers.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:23.870
And all your teams can
build APIs once, and reuse

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:27.080
